WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.740
What’s taking them so long?

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.280
Kotoko-chan, how did it go?

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:12.870
Three months.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.310
It’s true, right? It’s really true, isn’t it?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.080
There’s no mistake this time, right?

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.500
Yeah, there’s no mistake.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.590
Congratulations, Kotoko-chan.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.110
Onii-chan.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.340
Thank goodness.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.910
Well done, Naoki.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.520
Good for you, Kotoko!

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.350
I’m sure your mother in heaven would be overjoyed as well!

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.370
Hurry and get changed.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.470
We’re having a party after all.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.330
What is this?

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.060
They said that they’re thinking of names for the baby.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.390
Yeah, we have to think
long and hard about it.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.790
We’re just one stroke short.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.200
The plan was that everyone would get to choose three names.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:04.710
Gosh, Shigetarou? I thought I told you that it’s going to be a girl.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:07.580
Mother, we still don’t know the gender yet.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.980
It’s definitely going to be a girl.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:10.360
Rejected.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.030
After all the trouble I took
to come up with it...

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:16.320
Cheers!

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.610
How’s this?

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:22.430
Let’s play together!

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.070
They sure can’t sit still.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.400
Honestly, they’re getting overexcited.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.030
Umm, Irie-kun?

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.280
Aren’t you...

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:40.930
...happy?

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.510
Are you stupid or something?

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.100
Of course I’m happy.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:55.050
We’re going to be parents, aren’t we?

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.540
Kotoko, congratulations!

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.110
Thank you everyone!

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:36.270
A wonderful darling and a cute baby.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.870
This is every girl’s dream!

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:41.550
Say, Kotoko-san, what about work?

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.120
I plan to do as much as I’m capable of.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.000
Irie-kun approved as well.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.700
What a nice husband.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.610
Intelligent and good looking to boot.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.710
And understanding on top of that.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.460
You’re truly lucky, Kotoko.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.100
My friend is pregnant as well.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.270
But, her husband had an affair
with his co-worker.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:03.140
Yeah, that does happen often during pregnancy, doesn’t it?

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.620
Really?

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:08.020
They should be treating their wives the kindest during those times.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.580
But, it’s also suspicious
if they act too kind.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.900
Yeah, husbands become abnormally kind when they’re having affairs.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.350
Really?

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.410
Why would they do such things when they already have a wife?

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.660
Whether they’re married or not...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.110
...men like young girls.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.780
Well, to them, a plain-looking wife without makeup would...

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:32.550
...probably be less attractive than a lively girl on the outside.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:35.110
Without makeup?

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.410
But you don’t have to worry,
right, Kotoko-san?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.050
Because you’re actively working and all.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.980
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:52.850
And the patient was so delighted.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:53.910
Who is she?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.770
Irie-kun is actually laughing!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.870
Yukie-chan, can you handle this please?

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:00.950
Okay.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.550
I’ve gotten used to this...

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.650
This is bad. I can’t let this go on!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.700
I’m very happy that you feel that way.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.990
But, I really can’t...

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:17.830
What?!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.200
You don’t trust me?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.650
It’s not that.

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.930
So, let’s go then.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.200
Don’t tell me, Irie-kun is...

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.610
I don’t want that to happen!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.860
What are you doing?

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.060
Aihara-san?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:37.550
Matsumoto Yuuko!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.070
You look like you’re having fun. Playing hide and seek in the hospital?

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:42.050
No!

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.810
By the way, why are you with Irie-kun?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.240
Detailed examination?

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:52.140
Irie-kun suggested it when I was here last time because of anemia.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.660
They said it was a duodenal ulcer.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.880
So that’s what it was...

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.830
The blood test results
didn’t look good either.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.960
So I told her she should be admitted, but she didn’t want to.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.220
Why?

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:04.750
I had work.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.810
I can’t afford to be admitted
for a month here.

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.180
You can’t take this lightly!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:13.810
There are some cases where inflammation occurs and emergency surgery has to be done.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:19.120
You won’t be able to get any work done either if you neglect it and end up fainting all the time.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.240
Thank goodness.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:25.990
You managed to convince Matsumoto-san.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:29.970
Yeah, it’s good timing as well since I’ll be in internal medicine for a while.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.780
You’ll still be helping internal medicine?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:36.010
Yeah, looks like they’re
understaffed as usual.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.130
I see.

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:42.380
But, her husband had an affair
with his co-worker.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.910
Oh yeah, a trainee nurse just joined internal medicine, right?

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:48.710
Yeah.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.200
How nice. Innocent and all.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:55.480
Yeah. She’s very cute and tries her best.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:59.400
Men like young girls.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.250
By the way,
why are you wearing makeup?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.370
Well, I thought that I should wear makeup once in a while.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.080
You know, it’s not good to look too plain.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.910
That’s nice. It looks good.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.800
Yeah, husbands become abnormally kind when they’re having affairs.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:24.430
Irie-kun is being kinder than usual.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:26.090
Could this be...?

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.010
What’s wrong?

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.770
Nothing...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.810
Excuse me.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.370
How are you feeling?

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.390
I’m fine. The pain has subsided as well.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.990
Really? That’s good.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.710
He’s with her again!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.250
Oh, Aihara-san.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.530
You’re in surgery, aren’t you?
Why are you here?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:56.920
Well, obviously because
I’m worried about you.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.200
Yukie-chan, check her temperature please.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.190
Okay.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.640
Chan! He said chan!

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.420
Matsumoto!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.620
Sudou-san.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.990
Are you all right?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.740
Keep it down. It’s nothing major.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.730
What are you saying?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.870
It must be serious
since you’ve been admitted!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.970
It’s just a duodenal ulcer!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.070
It’s nothing to get worked up over!

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.410
Irie, can I have a moment?

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.620
Irie, tell me the truth.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.220
What’s she really suffering from?

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:35.660
A duodenal ulcer like she said.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.580
You can tell me the truth.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.410
Do you want her to be suffering from a serious illness that badly?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.470
You’re really, really telling
the truth, right?

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.070
It’s true.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.120
Thank goodness.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.740
You really have a lot of willpower, Sempai.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:50.420
Eight years of unrequited love.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.480
You’re the last person
I want to hear that from.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.510
He’s got a point.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:09:00.240
A lot has happened to me during those eight years.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:04.160
But in the end, I go back to Matsumoto.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:10.020
To be loved like that
must be every girl’s dream.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.560
Stairs.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.700
You’re always tripping down them, right?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.520
More insincere moves.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.930
No matter how you see it, this kindness...

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.260
...is a sign of unfaithfulness?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.730
I sure get a lot of trust.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.500
What are you saying?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:36.760
Trust between husband and wife
sure is fragile.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:42.110
Come on. Why would I suspect you?

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:45.700
Sheesh, Irie-kun. And I was wondering what you were going to say.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.490
Honestly, be careful.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:50.980
Right after I warned you too.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.490
Thanks.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.870
It’s great to be loved.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:06.600
To think that the unicell organism had the ability to come this far...

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.130
It’s enviable in a way.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:22.850
I thank you all for coming during such a busy period.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.730
After working at Shige for eight years...

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:29.230
...I can now open my own restaurant thanks to all of your support.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:34.440
I’ll do my best with what I’ve learned as to not disgrace you, boss.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:38.950
Please give us your support!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.540
Good luck!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.000
Thank you very much!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:45.120
A successor to the shop’s name, eh?
Kin-chan has finally made a name for himself.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.490
It’s really quite something, especially at such a young age.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.100
Good for you, Chris.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.320
Yes!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:53.990
Also, I have one more thing to tell you all.

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:57.010
I feel that this would be a good opportunity to have a wedding ceremony for Chris.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.970
Kinnosuke.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.970
Chris, sorry for making you wait.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:06.440
As a matter of a man’s pride, I wanted to come get you only after I became a full-fledged chef.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.280
Kinnosuke!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.530
Congratulations!

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.240
All right! Let’s have another toast!

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.080
Looks like we don’t have enough beer.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.260
I’ll go get more.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.780
A pregnant lady shouldn’t be moving about so much.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.370
I’ll go.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.220
Kinnosuke, well done.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.410
A man’s gotta do,
what a man’s gotta do.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.660
The happy times just keep coming.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.990
Kotoko is going to be a mama soon too.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:31.550
A kid is giving birth to a kid.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.980
How rude! I’m a mature adult.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:38.710
What’s going on?

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.270
Excuse me, but the place
is reserved tonight.

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:47.820
We’re not officially opened yet.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.780
Maria Robbins?!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:55.660
Who?

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.980
You don’t know who? She’s a very famous Hollywood actress!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:11:59.900
Mama!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:03.030
It’s been a while, Chris.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.870
Mama, why are you here?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.030
Your father wrote me a letter.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.130
I saw that.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.190
Letter?

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:15.630
I told her about the new restaurant.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:19.310
My father opposes the marriage.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.970
He wouldn’t allow his daughter to be taken by a fledging man.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.270
He’s never met Kinnosuke too.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:30.540
So, I just had to tell them when Kinnosuke opened his own restaurant.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.760
Chris...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.730
Nice to meet you.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.000
My name is Ikezawa Kinnosuke.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.700
Sorry for the belated introduction, but please let me marry Chris!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.260
Is your mother against the marriage?

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.010
It’s not that.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.340
She’s very particular about looks,

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:58.210
so she keeps telling me that she won’t allow the marriage if my darling isn’t handsome.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.210
Looks like it’s over for Kin-chan.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.840
She’ll probably turn him down with those kinda looks.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.190
Chris.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:09.090
Where did you ever find such a great guy?

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:14.670
I knew you would say that!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.730
Their family is handsome-challenged...

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.980
I approve of your marriage
with your darling.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.010
I’ll convince your father.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:25.100
It won’t be a problem. He won’t dare go against me.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.020
Mama!

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:26.950
That easily?

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.830
I know a man’s value with just one look.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.870
Kinnosuke passes with flying colors.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.960
Thank you very much!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.130
I’ll make Chris happy for sure!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.750
Now that that’s decided, let’s prepare the wedding ceremony.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.770
Ah, I plan to have it
in my hometown, Osaka.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.970
No, we’ll have the ceremony in England.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.930
Chris is a daughter of the Robbins family.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.910
I’ll invite Charles too and have a grand celebration.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.980
Charles? She doesn’t mean...

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.720
Please stop deciding on your own!

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.400
We’re having it in Japan.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.580
No can do.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.300
I’d like you to grant my wishes.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:13.280
And in the end, Kin-chan gave in, so they’ll be having the ceremony in England.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.800
Her father is the president of a major bank.

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.710
And her mother is a Hollywood actress.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:21.790
Plus, they’re related to royalty.
It’ll certainly be a very grand ceremony.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.160
Matsumoto, what do you think about having our ceremony in Karuizawa?

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:29.380
Exchanging vows of eternal love in a small chapel in the forest.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:33.270
How nice. We can ride in a carriage pulled by white horses too.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.490
White horses?

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.630
How wonderful!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.700
Isn’t it?

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:41.290
Oh yeah, Aihara.
I heard you were expecting?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.420
Congratulations.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.710
I’ll pray that your baby doesn’t
become like you.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:50.540
How nice. I want to be a father too.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:52.980
Are you all right?

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.050
Matsumoto-san?

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.120
Aihara, call for a doctor.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.830
It’s subsided already, so don’t worry.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.300
I think it’d be a good idea
to get some medicine.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.210
I’ll go ask for some
at the nurse station, okay?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.540
Yeah, please do.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.470
Okay, got it.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.090
Please do so then.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.140
Oh my, do you need some help?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:16.820
I’ll be fine!

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:18.690
You don’t have to be so reserved.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.260
No, I’ll really be fine.

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:21.360
Aihara!

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.740
What’s wrong?

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.460
Matsumoto...

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.600
She disappeared.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:29.580
After I came back from the restroom, her room was completely empty.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.480
Matsumoto!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:43.450
Got it. Tell me once you get in touch with the contacts and the other side.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.000
Matsumoto! What are you doing here?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.830
I can’t do my work in the room because you two make such a ruckus there.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.590
Forget work!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.120
You have to keep still and get some rest!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.890
He’s right. Otherwise you won’t recover.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.160
It’s a critical moment where we’re closing this big business deal!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.830
I can’t afford to relax and sleep.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:02.670
Yes?

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.600
Got it. I’ll be right there.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.490
You’ll be there? Where?

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.170
Where the client is.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.580
It’s an emergency.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.610
You can’t.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.750
You need the doctor’s permission to leave the hospital.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.890
Then, go deal with that somehow.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:17.950
I couldn’t possibly...

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:21.850
Hey, what are...?!

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:23.150
Sudou-sempai?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.740
What’s your problem?!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.180
Please, just lie down.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.410
Stop acting so big!

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.100
Lie down!

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.010
I told you not to overwork yourself!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.310
Stop interfering with my work!

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.100
I can’t let you!

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.870
Get out of the way already!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.100
No! I won’t move.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.400
I’ll take care of this for you.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.580
Huh? Hey, give it back!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.940
Which is more important?
Your body or your work?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.520
I don’t need you taking care of me!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:53.030
Whatever happens to my health is none of your business!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.560
Cut it out already!

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.540
Sudou-sempai!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:03.770
Matsumoto?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.720
Sudou-sempai!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.210
Matsumoto!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:18.020
Matsumoto-san!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.010
Wait, Matsumoto-san! Calm down!
Quit joking! Why do I have to...?

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.640
Quit joking! Why do I have to...?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.400
Hey, where are you going?

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:27.280
Work, obviously!

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:28.780
In those clothes?

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:33.000
Let’s go back in for now.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.120
You should put something cold on it.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:40.750
Irie. I showed a pathetic side
of myself, didn’t I?

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:45.500
Are you sure it was a good idea to anger Matsumoto?

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:51.450
I don’t care what she thinks of me, as long as her health recovers.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.160
Matsumoto works too hard.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.040
She was the same in the past.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.790
She appears perfect on the outside.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:02.230
But, behind the scenes, she’s the one working the hardest.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:06.430
Also, establishing her company probably required a lot of effort.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.290
She’ll definitely collapse one day if she doesn’t get some rest.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.570
Thus, even if she were to hate me
or whatever...

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.610
...right now, I just want to
protect her health.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.370
She can work again after she recovers.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.130
Am I an annoyance?

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.200
You are.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:29.200
But, there are cases of people getting used to that annoyance.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:37.310
It’s great to have someone who understands you, don’t you think?

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:40.810
Irie-kun sees through me completely.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.920
He knows all of my bad points,
yet he stays by me.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:50.940
Often times, I think that’s why I’m able to do my best.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.400
No matter how hard the task at hand, I remind myself to try hard again tomorrow.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.030
Matsumoto?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.680
You’re in the way. Move it.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.840
I won’t attempt to leave
the hospital any more.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.840
So, get back to your office.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:13.150
But...

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:17.840
Besides, what’s an office worker doing hanging around here on a weekday afternoon?

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.850
I’m free to use my time however I want in my trade.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.700
And your work performance has dropped because of that, right?

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.860
Who cares about that.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.040
I’m more concerned about your health at the moment.

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.860
Don’t shift the blame to me.

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:33.600
If you want to ride in a horse carriage, then go sell some cars now.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:38.230
I like men who are capable workers.

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.260
Matsumoto-san.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.240
Aihara.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.990
Please take care of Matsumoto.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:47.110
Wait for me.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:50.580
I’ll achieve the best sales and come get you!

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.200
What are these?

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:04.050
Yuuki, you must never tell
Kotoko-chan about this.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.560
This girl is cute.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:09.440
Her health is most important
to her right now.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.830
If she were to find out that she’s being cheated on...

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:12.910
I’m home!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:13.570
She’s back!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.520
Onii-chan, come.

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.720
What is it?

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:21.070
Be honest with me.

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.800
What kind of girl is she?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.000
Don’t think you can get away
by making excuses.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.570
I’m ashamed.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:32.080
What a despicable thing to do when you already have Kotoko-chan!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.700
I don’t remember raising you that way.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:38.670
Mother, is something the matter?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:41.380
Yukie-chan.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.680
It’s not what you think, Kotoko-chan!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.090
They’re not shocking pictures.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.930
It’s not adultery or an affair
or anything like that.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.570
Seriously, how much free time does my mother have?

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:59.150
Even though there’s no way you’d be committing adultery.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.800
Mother always gets worried so easily.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.530
And what about yourself?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.120
Come on, I’m not worried about it at all...

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:10.800
What’s wrong?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.350
It moved.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:14.910
The baby moved!

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.200
Really?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.340
We’re really going to be parents, aren’t we?

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:26.830
At that time, we still weren’t aware...

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:32.260
...that an unforeseen trial awaited us.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.780
A-A trial?! I didn't know anything about this!

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:12.840
Kotoko! I'm with you!

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:14.950
Kotoko has Naoki with her.

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:18.380
Why don't we plan our wedding outfits, Kinnosuke?

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:19.450
Sure, but...

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:23.210
Oh, very very cute and nice foreign vest, Kinnosuke!

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:27.090
What's with these clothes?

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.360
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:31.180
Happy Love Carnival.

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.130
I'm definitely gonna be happy!
